  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nDrop a 1-HP heart every 5
    seconds in combat.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Shop rarity: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nThey kept air pockets along
    a drowned road and rescued people who later forgot it existed. They collect those
    accounts to stop another town building over it. They want witnesses rather than
    a grateful statue.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon damage gains 0.5% per companion
    body in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed talents count
    bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by
    star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal, clover, morning. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
